# Excluded from the Cloudflare upload (Pages manual deploy and Workers Assets build).
# Anything uploaded is served publicly at its path, so keep this to site assets only.
# Video is served from Cloudflare Stream (playback=stream), so local media/ is not needed.
# docs/ is intentionally NOT listed: it holds the three public writing samples
# linked from writing.html and must be served.
media/
.git/
.git
node_modules/
tools/
.claude/
kb/
worker/
.dev.vars
AGENTS.md
.DS_Store
.env
.github/
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
.wrangler/

# Added 2026-08-21 after a deploy published these publicly (HTTP 200 on the apex).
# .claude/ was listed but these siblings were not, so agent + editor working
# directories shipped as site assets. Root cause: the list enumerated known dirs
# instead of excluding dotfiles as a class.
.writing-coach/
.cursor/
.coderabbit.yaml
.coderabbit*.yaml
.vscode/
.idea/
.scratch/
.venv/
private/*
!private/
!private/for-ambience.html
!private/ambience-review.css
# macOS "Something 2.ext" duplicates. These are stale byte-copies of real pages,
# so they serve outdated content at a live URL long after the original is fixed.
* 2.html
* 2.yaml
* 2.json
* 2.md
